@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 19
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ParticipantPadding 20
skinparam maxMessageSize 280
skinparam BoxPadding 10
hide footbox
actor Supervisor as S
boundary "Web interface" as UI
control "FastAPI" as API
database "Store" as DB
actor "Mission Operator" as O
S -> UI : Submit area polygon and operator
UI -> API : Create survey area assignment
API -> API : Check Supervisor permission, operator,\narea size and polygon validity
alt Submission rejected
  API --> UI : Validation / access error
else Assignment accepted
  API -> DB : Save assignment at revision 1;\nappend revision snapshot and audit event
  API --> UI : Assigned survey area
end
O -> UI : Select assigned area and registered UAV
loop Each survey sector
  O -> UI : Draw rectangle, circle or free shape; edit handles
  UI -> UI : Retain previous sector drafts; Undo / Redo
  UI -> API : Preview survey lanes and proposed boundary
  API -> API : Validate shape, connected route and assignment
  API --> UI : Lane preview or validation feedback
end
O -> UI : Select sector and save its UAV-specific plan
UI -> API : Save sub-mission draft
API -> DB : Lock parent assignment; check operator
API -> API : Check geometry and flight limits;\narea contains boundary; boundary contains route
alt Draft rejected
  API --> UI : Error; no mission created
else Draft accepted
  API -> DB : Save DRAFT mission and creation records
  API --> UI : DRAFT mission
  O -> UI : Request plan validation
  UI -> API : Validate mission
  API -> DB : Lock parent before mission
  API -> API : Check assigned operator, state,\ngeometry and parent containment again
  alt Validation fails
    API --> UI : Validation error; no flight
  else Validation succeeds
    API -> DB : Set READY; append ready mission event
    API --> UI : READY; explicit start available
  end
end
note over API, DB
  Reassignment moves DRAFT / READY missions to the new operator
  as DRAFT. Active linked missions block assignment edits.
  FR-13–FR-27; creation and validation never initiate flight.
end note
@enduml
